📋 IMPLEMENTATION PLAN

See: IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN-EXTEND-STATISTICAL-RESEARCH.md

**Phase 1: Zotero Integration** (4 hours)
- lib/zotero.sh - SQLite queries against ~/Zotero/zotero.sqlite
- commands/zotero/* - Search, cite, annotate
- 2,728 library items accessible via Claude

**Phase 2: PDF Integration** (3 hours)
- lib/pdf-extract.sh - pdftotext extraction
- commands/pdf/* - Extract, search, summarize
- ~1,800 PDFs (research + teaching)

**Phase 3: Vault Operations** (4 hours)
- lib/obsidian.sh - Read/write/search vault
- commands/vault/* - Read, write, search, link
- Full Obsidian vault access

**Phase 4: Knowledge Query** (3 hours)
- skills/knowledge/* - Unified search
- commands/knowledge/* - Cross-source queries
- "Ask anything" across all sources

**Phase 5: Integration & Testing** (2 hours)
- End-to-end workflows
- Error handling
- Documentation

**Total: 16 hours over 4-5 days**

